# トレー (design 11.27), for tools/ui_run.py: two numbers put into the tray
# from 電卓 with Ctrl+C, the accessory opened from its program, the levels
# chosen with the arrow keys and the digits, the window built again when
# another set is put in while it is open, and the menu's 一覧表示 and
# 付せん表示. The tags stand down the window's left side, a tag for
# each of the ten levels, those that hold nothing greyed: the tag of
# level N at 205, 145+26(N-1).
open 01a0d8c4-5320-7a41-8b52-6c7d8e9fa020
expect calculator: ready
wait 800
click 837 230
expect calculator: shown 0 []
key 1E
key 1F
key 06 01
expect calculator: copied 12
click 837 230
key 20
key 21
key 22
key 06 01
expect calculator: copied 345
open 01a0d8c4-5430-7a31-8b42-5c6d7e8f5430
expect trayview: opened, 2 levels
wait 800
win トレー
shot trv_open
key 51
expect trayview: level 2
wait 300
shot trv_level2
key 1E
expect trayview: level 1
# another set put in while the window is open: level 1 is the new one
win 電卓
click 837 230
key 23
key 24
key 06 01
expect calculator: copied 67
expect trayview: changed, 3 levels, level 1 文章
open 01a0d8c4-5430-7a31-8b42-5c6d7e8f5430
wait 500
win トレー
shot trv_changed
key 20
expect trayview: level 3
# the menu: opened with 閉じる under the pointer
click 400 300 1
wait 600
shot trv_menu
move 400 341
wait 150
move 500 341
wait 300
shot trv_menu_view
key 29
key 29
wait 300
# a link put in: TADjsについて chosen in the window BTRON and copied
click 100 90
key 06 01
expect trayview: changed, 4 levels, level 1 仮身
wait 500
shot trv_link
# a picture put in: 画面印刷 takes the window in front into the tray at PrintScreen
open 01a0d8c4-53d0-7a21-8b32-4c5d6e7f53d0
expect scrprint: panel 1
wait 600
click 414 339
click 650 313
click 414 455
click 836 511
expect scrprint: armed 1
move 300 300
wait 300
key 46
expect scrprint: tray
expect trayview: changed, 5 levels, level 1 画像
open 01a0d8c4-5430-7a31-8b42-5c6d7e8f5430
wait 800
shot trv_picture
# 表示 > 一覧表示: a row for each level; the arrow keys go down the rows
win トレー
click 400 300 1
wait 600
move 400 341
wait 150
move 500 341
wait 300
click 530 361
expect trayview: list, tags on
key 51
expect trayview: level 2 仮身
wait 300
shot trv_list
# 付せん表示 off (the menu opens with 表示, chosen last, under the pointer)
click 400 300 1
wait 600
move 410 300
wait 150
move 500 300
wait 300
shot trv_menu_again
click 530 361
expect trayview: list, tags off
# 詳細表示, the document of level 5 drawn as its text alone
click 400 300 1
wait 600
move 410 300
wait 150
move 500 300
wait 300
click 530 300
expect trayview: detail, tags off
key 22
expect trayview: level 5 文章
wait 300
shot trv_tags_off
# a press on the tag of level 3; the greyed tag of level 7 is not chosen
click 205 197
expect trayview: level 3 文章
click 205 301
wait 300
shot trv_tag_pressed
key 08 01
expect trayview: closed
